    "A doubling means multiplying the current population by \\(2\\). Starting with \\(10\\) students:\n\n\\[\n10 \\xrightarrow{\\text{1 month}} 20\n\\xrightarrow{\\text{2 months}} 40\n\\xrightarrow{\\text{3 months}} 80.\n\\]\n\nEquivalently,\n\n\\[\n10\\cdot 2^3=80.\n\\]\n\nTherefore, after three completed months, there will be\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{80\\text{ students}}.\n\\]",
